file: crates/cortex-core/src/knowledge.rs
in: apply
find: if change.text.as_deref().is_some_and(finds) { return Err(credential("An entry's new text")); }
replace:
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it knowledge::the_command_line_lists_and_changes_a_projects_entries

[break] the-command-line-lists-an-expired-entry-as-in-use
rule: The command line's listing marks an entry past its expiry first.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/knowledge.rs
in: listing
find: snapshot = lapsed.snapshot;
replace: let _ = lapsed;
caught-by:
